cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "DataConfessor"
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
type: software
abstract: >-
  A pre-training privacy screen for medical datasets. Ranks patients by atypicality
  using four throwaway proxy models and flags those most likely to be exposed by
  membership inference, before a production model is trained.
license: MIT
